# Internal research, personal validation evidence, and generated design assets.
# These stay local and are intentionally excluded from the public preview repo.
#
# Product artifacts are NOT ignored: `spec/` (the living PRD and SDD) and `docs/`
# (architecture, privacy, release) ship with the repo, because a reader cloning it should be
# able to see what the product is meant to do and how it is put together. `docs/archive/` ships
# too — it is the pre-0.7 record, and it is history rather than a current entry point.
#
# The numbered top-level convention (`/[0-9][0-9]-*.md`, plus three `!` exemptions that pulled
# 02- / 04- / 05- back in) was retired on 2026-10-02: those three files moved to `docs/archive/`
# and were replaced by `spec/PRD.md` + `spec/SDD.md`. The pattern is gone rather than kept as a
# trap, since a numbered file silently failing to be committed is exactly the failure it used to
# cause. `/specs/` stays ignored so the retired name cannot come back by accident.
/.audit/
/00_原型与迭代方案/
/01_重构方案/
/99_归档/
/specs/
/.dsh-illustration-family/
